          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.085,
            0.848,
            0.126
          ],
          "content": "？ The following table lists the thickness after each fold. Observe that the thickness doubles after each fold."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.131,
            0.772,
            0.318
          ],
          "content": "| Fold | Thickness | Fold | Thickness | Fold | Thickness |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | 0.002 cm | 7 | 0.128 cm | 13 | 8.192 cm |\n| 2 | 0.004 cm | 8 | 0.256 cm | 14 | 16.384 cm |\n| 3 | 0.008 cm | 9 | 0.512 cm | 15 | 32.768 cm |\n| 4 | 0.016 cm | 10 | 1.024 cm | 16 | 65.536 cm |\n| 5 | 0.032 cm | 11 | 2.048 cm | 17 | ≈ 131 cm |\n| 6 | 0.064 cm | 12 | 4.096 cm |  |  |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_table_1.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.323,
            0.83,
            0.38
          ],
          "content": "(We use the sign ‘≈’ to indicate ‘approximately equal to’.) After 10 folds, the thickness is just above 1 cm (1.024 cm). After 17 folds, the thickness is about 131 cm (a little more than 4 feet)."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.109,
            0.381,
            0.803,
            0.422
          ],
          "content": "Now, what do you think the thickness would be after 30 folds? 45 folds? Make a guess."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.821,
            0.382,
            0.878,
            0.417
          ],
          "content": "Math Talk"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.428,
            0.347,
            0.452
          ],
          "content": "Fill the table below."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.457,
            0.791,
            0.562
          ],
          "content": "| Fold | Thickness | Fold Thickness | Fold Thickness |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 18 | ≈ 262 cm | 21 | 24 |\n| 19 | ≈ 524 cm | 22 | 25 |\n| 20 | ≈ 10.4 m | 23 | 26 |",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_1_table_6.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.567,
            0.79,
            0.606
          ],
          "content": "After 26 folds, the thickness is approximately 670 m. Burj Khalifa in Dubai, the tallest building in the world, is 830 m tall."
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.609,
            0.591,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": "| Fold | Thickness | Thickness Fold |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 27 | ≈ 1.3 km | 29 |\n| 28 |  | 30 |",
